From: OneKVM Project <223006751+lowtech-guy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] modules: allow a minimal directory list

Some optional modules, notably audio, contain only vendor-toolchain-specific
prebuilt objects.  Allow integrators to build the source-based modules they
actually consume without changing the vendor default.

Upstream-Status: Pending

---
 modules/Makefile | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/modules/Makefile b/modules/Makefile
index f931c50..443d397 100644
--- a/modules/Makefile
+++ b/modules/Makefile
@@ -6,6 +6,10 @@ endif
 
 SUB_DIRS = sys bin vi vo vpss rgn gdc audio mipi_tx venc vdec misc ive isp
 
+ifneq ($(ONEKVM_MODULE_DIRS),)
+SUB_DIRS := $(ONEKVM_MODULE_DIRS)
+endif
+
 all:
 	@echo "########################################################################################################"
 	@echo "#"
-- 
2.50.1
